<entry dateCreated="2021-09-23T14:54:36Z" dateModified="2025-11-12T16:05:13Z" id="aaskir_395ed2b7-eeb5-4851-bc00-fcedb6751a6c" guid="395ed2b7-eeb5-4851-bc00-fcedb6751a6c">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>aaskir</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>Used with long-vowel pronominal prefixes to indicate possession, this clitic forms kinship terms meaning “in-law.”

- eeskir (ee–sk–hir, aa–sk–hir, moo–sk–hir, oo–sk–hir) → father-in-law of the possessor 
- eeskus (ee–sk–gus, aa–sk–gus, moo–sk–gus, oo–sk–gus) → mother-in-law of the possessor

The plural form for both male and female in-laws is –sk–indaru, which also requires pronominal possession. During elision, the consonants /h/ and /g/ following /k/ may weaken or drop. Instead of the words aa-sk-hir and aa-sk-gus, the prevalent terms are aaskir and askus.  Urd</text></form>
</note>
<relation type="Compare" ref="hir_abd81050-2a2d-4c9c-b0f1-39b21376f491"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="-sk-_a5f491e4-aff4-4ffd-9b25-c8838c1c8a09"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="aaskus_724627af-aec1-4103-a0b6-759471aa4eb7"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>aːskir</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>آسکِر</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Plural Suffix">
<form lang="bsk"><text>-r, índaru</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Possessed">
<form lang="bsk"><text>skir</text></form>
</field>
<trait name="Possessors" value="O-Obligatorily Possessors"/>
<sense id="dfb48396-83ba-476a-93f9-a0839cf12d3d">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>1SG father in law, my father in law</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>میرا سسر</text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.1.9 Kinship"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-05-27T15:55:37Z" dateModified="2025-11-12T16:08:00Z" id="aaskus_724627af-aec1-4103-a0b6-759471aa4eb7" guid="724627af-aec1-4103-a0b6-759471aa4eb7">
