<entry dateCreated="2024-07-31T04:40:11Z" dateModified="2025-11-21T04:58:32Z" id="amiśki aćumaa_3deb80b5-96d0-4a67-8a1f-d6fe85f397c2" guid="3deb80b5-96d0-4a67-8a1f-d6fe85f397c2">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>amiśki aćumaa</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="phrase"/>
<relation type="_component-lexeme" ref="c7b74994-0a33-414f-a286-ed0a6b39dccb" order="0">
<trait name="is-primary" value="true"/>
<trait  name="complex-form-type" value="Phrasal Verb"/>
</relation>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Idioms"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>amiʃki atʃumaː</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>امِشکێ آچُما؟</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="a3bd29b9-3ae6-4b6e-a8bb-3a8af41fa037">
<grammatical-info value="Idiom">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>What are you going to do, shave my pubic hair? This colloquial expression is typically used in response to a warning, threat, or attempt at intimidation. It conveys defiance and dismissal, essentially meaning: “You can’t actually do anything to me” or “Your threat is powerless.”</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کیا بگاڑو گے میرا؟</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-12-25T04:31:24Z" dateModified="2025-11-20T14:35:09Z" id="amiśtono_81842e49-d900-4bb4-8091-820660beb052" guid="81842e49-d900-4bb4-8091-820660beb052">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>amiśtono</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>A compound formed from two Khowar words: amisht (‘mix’) and dono (‘of butter’). The term is also widely used among Burushaski speakers, which warrants its inclusion here.</text></form>
</note>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>amiʃtono</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>امِشتوࣷنوࣷ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="dcc88775-5954-4a88-a758-2249375bc675">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A type of food, made of cheese mixed with butter, eaten with bread.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کھانے کی ایک قسم۔ </text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.2 Food"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-04-27T06:08:44Z" dateModified="2025-11-19T15:16:29Z" id="amiśu_c00d411f-1d9f-4afa-9135-cb0420bd67af" guid="c00d411f-1d9f-4afa-9135-cb0420bd67af">
