<entry dateCreated="2022-11-14T02:41:40Z" dateModified="2025-11-22T14:45:56Z" id="áyan_dcd1e6ed-5d67-411e-9c7f-40a802a51ffc" guid="dcd1e6ed-5d67-411e-9c7f-40a802a51ffc">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>áyan</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>

As the prefix /a/ represents 1SG, it would be a direct order to oneself to sleep. In real life, however, one would not order oneself or a 3rd Person - this construction is non‑functional in everyday speech. To native speakers, it feels odd or nearly meaningless.  - Outside of this imperative context, the verb yan is fully productive and used in all other forms (indicative, subjunctive, past, future, etc.). In future construction, however, the 'n' in -yan- is dropped (e.g ayayam, goyayuma)</text></form>
</note>
<relation type="Compare" ref="yáṅ ce_eace15c4-1df0-4161-927e-42fe3441e528"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="dáthalla_46094844-382a-411c-a570-0cfa626c45d8"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="máyániṅ_15eebcd7-ddec-4083-a2cc-0cd796b40313"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>ʌyan</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>اَیَن</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Possessed">
<form lang="bsk"><text>yán</text></form>
</field>
<trait name="Possessors" value="U-Obligatorily Possessors"/>
<sense id="049d84ab-e166-4125-af67-f9cc638c12c4">
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja saṭik akho nukućha, áyana. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Yesterday, I lied down here and fell a sleep. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un góyan, ja dáṅ api. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You sleep, I am not sleepy.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne hir éyani.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>That man fell asleep.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-05-20T14:36:01Z" dateModified="2025-11-23T15:25:14Z" id="áyanze_6023e0bd-6747-4735-9467-f5cce1261e01" guid="6023e0bd-6747-4735-9467-f5cce1261e01">
<lexical-unit>
