<sense id="70c3fc82-4281-45bb-8d6b-08a03cf44304">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>1SG.separated, apart (from joint family, group, companions, etc.), Specifically: living apart from a joint family household — marking independence or detachment from the extended kin unit.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>(میں)الگ سے، اکیلا</text></gloss>
<example>
