<entry dateCreated="2019-08-26T17:06:53Z" dateModified="2025-11-27T15:25:36Z" id="baastimi_e260b86d-39d5-46aa-9d5e-4ee59810b80d" guid="e260b86d-39d5-46aa-9d5e-4ee59810b80d">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>baastimi</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>

Used exclusively in quotative speech or reported evidentiality to indicate finding, hearsay or reported information. It attaches to copula bases or bare verbs, agreeing in person and number. 

Forms: 
- bai (is) → baastimi → 3SG.hm
- bu (is) → buastumu → 3SG.hf 
- bi (is) → bastimi → 3SG.x 
- duwa (is) → duwastimi → 3SG.y 
- biyen (are) → biyenastemen → 3PLx 
- bica (are) → bicastimi → y.PL 
- ba (am) → bastam → 2SG 
- ba (are) → bastuma → 2PL 
-et (do) → etastimi → 3SG.hm.reportedly used to do

Note: The clitic -ast- precedes agreement suffixes and does not alter gender or number marking.</text></form>
</note>
<relation type="Compare" ref="ba_50d58f94-a938-413a-8b7d-6f858e60de80"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="mi1_c2451b3a-b691-4e06-bed0-fc2aad9b13f8"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="apaastimi_ecd8a3f2-41fc-4bf5-9248-2b7cc31c45e0"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>baːstimi</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>باستِمی</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="2555250f-b163-46b5-b691-82b6a5c447ec">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>3SG.hm was, used to be or happened to be</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کہا جاتا ہے یا معلوم پڑتا ہے کہ (شخص) تھا</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>chor hek an hir en baastimi, ne hir darúskin  baastimi. ne daru etastimi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>In earlier times, there happened to be a man. He reportedly used to be a hunter. He used to hunt. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-08-14T00:18:21Z" dateModified="2025-11-27T15:35:39Z" id="baat_81aa11fd-c476-4fe1-8c71-d35d61bc0c0c" guid="81aa11fd-c476-4fe1-8c71-d35d61bc0c0c">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>baat</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
