<grammatical-info value="Noun Phrase">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>The third irrigation of crop after plowing. This comes after 'yaṭiki' and it is known as late jointing and, for a wheat crop, ideally undertaken 65-70 days after sowing.</text></gloss>
