<gloss lang="en"><text>mowed, without grass or bushes</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>ایسی جگہ جہاں  ابھی ابھی فصل یا گھاس کاٹی گئی ہو۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-04-16T23:43:12Z" dateModified="2025-12-03T16:57:29Z" id="baṭá1_08dbf5b6-1ac5-4ffc-8de6-a4e53ce6049b" guid="08dbf5b6-1ac5-4ffc-8de6-a4e53ce6049b">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>baṭá</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>baʈʌ</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>بٹاࣷ</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Plural Suffix">
<form lang="bsk"><text>iṅ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="bbd8f6ca-d381-498e-b33f-a0bbd96a90b0" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>An abandoned, dilapidated building whose roof has collapsed.  ruins of a building</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کھنڈر مکان</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>hakićaṅ baṭaṅ manum bica. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>The houses have become ruins/dilapidated</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
<sense id="fbd81f9e-ceec-46dd-85fe-8b0f75656bde" order="1">
<gloss lang="en"><text>a building that has its roof removed or not done yet</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>وہ عمارت جس کی چھت یا تو گرادی گئ ہے  یا ابھی ڈالی نہ گئی ہو۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-12-26T20:22:24Z" dateModified="2025-12-03T16:42:26Z" id="báta_82e7c3bf-2620-4198-b0dd-aa2575dbd2d8" guid="82e7c3bf-2620-4198-b0dd-aa2575dbd2d8">
