<sense id="90421daa-5bab-4760-b09f-35186d6c9ce5">
<grammatical-info value="Idiom">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>acting supernatural, acting abnormally</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بھوت سوار ہونا، پاگلوں  کی طرح حرکتیں کرنا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>khene baṭa bo giim bi, behuuś manum bai. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Something has gotten into him (the one over here), he has become senseless. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
