<form lang="bsk"><text>bɛɛr̥tʃu</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>بیࣷرْچُو</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="f90fef97-9e56-4089-89b4-89b48ebf8ddf">
<grammatical-info value="Interrogative Adverb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>of what (size, length)? It is used only for plural</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کس سائیز کے، کتنے لمبے یا بڑے</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne hire huṭiṅ beérʰću bica?</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>What is the size of that man's feet?</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
