<grammatical-info value="Exclamation">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>of some size, of some size (big, tall etc.), used as an exclamatory question for size</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کتنے بڑے یا لمبے</text></gloss>
<example>
