</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>It is  also a generic term used by youngsters for any woman in her middle age. In Burusho societies, it is considered more polite to address someone with a relationship title rather than addressing with their name.  </text></form>
</note>
