<sense id="a4f09bf6-8d6e-466d-a7c0-bcdff1211e0e">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>An offering made in the name of Boyo, a mythical being who was likely once worshiped by the Buruśo peoplee. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بُویوࣷ دیوی کے نام کی قربانی</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>khos boyiki ġa ṣiṣen, biya mamú aiaćhiy. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>May they slaughter it for boyiki, the cow did not give me milk. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
