<sense id="96fb8067-7f06-47be-9ffb-c762e69a66d3">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A short roll of tripe, about 3.5 inch in size. tripe is cleaned by removing interior mucous lining  and then cut into small pieces to make rolls. The tripe rolls are wrapped in strings of small intestines. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>اُوجھڑی اور انتوں  کے رولزجو پکا کر کھائے جاتے ہیں۔</text></gloss>
<example>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-12-27T17:17:02Z" dateModified="2025-12-13T16:28:54Z" id="bullani1_87fa9370-264f-42af-96e1-acf6b63ada10" guid="87fa9370-264f-42af-96e1-acf6b63ada10">
