<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>plank (about 8.5×11 inches) with a short handle, used as shovel in water mill to manage flour. It is also considered a unit of measurement for phúi (see phúi).</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>لکڑی کا تختہ جس کو چکی  میں آٹےکے لیے بیلچہ کے طور پر استعمال ہوتا ہے۔   </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne hire alʰto buye <span lang="en">phúi</span> gim bai. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>That man has set aside two /buye/ of the /phui/</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.7 Tool"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-01-02T18:59:13Z" dateModified="2025-12-11T04:34:46Z" id="buyé2_5f409ba1-570a-4eef-b3ee-20f62aba7b0b" guid="5f409ba1-570a-4eef-b3ee-20f62aba7b0b">
