<sense id="e3dad98b-c70d-430c-9228-d7d54b04e988">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>plank (about 8.5×11 inches) with a long handle used in winnowing grains. It is used to pitch the grains, as the  pitchfork cannot hold the grains and hay</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>لمبے دستے کے ساتھ ایک تخہ جس سے گندم کو ہوا میں اُچھال کر صاف کیا جاتا ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.1 Household equipment"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-01-02T16:56:41Z" dateModified="2025-12-11T04:32:07Z" id="buz1_b7cb0de4-6b2f-4ea9-86c8-720466e7a3aa" guid="b7cb0de4-6b2f-4ea9-86c8-720466e7a3aa">
