<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>goosebumps, hair getting bristled due to fear or shock</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>رومانچ، رونکٹے  کھڑے ہونا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>hiṅ ce ṭaaṅ ce bootán diyem bim, ilʰćimo liu-liu nót. se níyec ayaṭes buz aati. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>In the dark, by the door, something was standing with glowing eyes. When I saw it, goosebumps spread across my skin and my hair stood on end.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
