<sense id="e08df27c-7d3c-4d6c-a256-3f4bd932c16c" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>human-directed touching with bad intent. grope, fondle. Touching someone with bad intent is socially abhorrent</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>دست درازی، بد نیتی سے چُھونے کا عمل</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>gus caap moćum </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>groping a woman. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
<sense id="263b0ee3-88c1-40a9-a914-1e899ee7613e" order="1">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>object-directed touching for tactile examination, touching an object to see its status such as softness, hotness etc.,</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>چھونے یا چھو کر دیکھنے کا عمل</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>guse dan caap net ġaan ka, taap ġayinćum bi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Touch the stone and check, it seems hot.  nj</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
