<grammatical-info value="Verb/Verbal Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>jolting or shaking of upper body, prancing, walking with exaggerated movement, as if one's body is bouncing</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>تواتر سے جسم  کے بالائی  حصے کو ہلانے کی حالت، جسم کو ہلا ہلا کرچلنے کی حالت </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>boo chochoq guwayum ba, yare huruṭa.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Why are you bouncing around, could you please sit down.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-01-11T03:51:53Z" dateModified="2025-12-24T21:08:58Z" id="chóq_cf1855b1-4ad0-4ba7-b5b1-57379e221fdd" guid="cf1855b1-4ad0-4ba7-b5b1-57379e221fdd">
