<sense id="acc67eb0-88af-4031-b5c5-5e99c63580e5">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>(of length) short especially due to misconfiguration or cutting with wrong measurement. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کسی چیز کی لمبائی   یا اونچائی جس میں تھوڑی کمی رہ گئی  ہو۔ خاص کر کاٹنے کے بعد</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>gaṭu śuwa cat mani. puṣ phukan con aaġaiṅćum duwa. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>The pants fitted well. The shirt seems (to me) a bit short.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja se śillan conkiṣ biya waallum bi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>That bobtailed cow of mine has lost. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
