</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>upheaval, disruption, disturbance</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>اودھم، کھلبلی</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>khene Trump ane gali ka, ćaqoṭi net phatćum bai. </text></form>
