<entry dateCreated="2020-02-04T16:55:49Z" dateModified="2025-12-31T05:02:51Z" id="ćarʰćan_78f7562d-9f35-4174-aeed-6da2fffd6d5b" guid="78f7562d-9f35-4174-aeed-6da2fffd6d5b">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ćarʰćan</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>tʃar̥tʃan</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>چرْچن</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Plural Suffix">
<form lang="bsk"><text>iṅ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="852af2af-4b1b-4bd4-8d30-ff6f96a04f08">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A fragile, ever‑eroding, nearly perpendicular mountain slope that is hazardous to traverse because the ground structure is too delicate to support a person’s hands or feet. Such slopes consist of loose soil, crumbling rock, or unstable sediment, requiring extreme caution when passing along or near them.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>پہاڑ کا عمودی ڈھلوان جس کی زمینی ساخت کمزور ہو، مٹی نرم اور گرنے کا اندیشہ ہو۔ایسی جگے  پر چلتے وقت  یا ایسی پہاڑی کے نزدیک سے گزرتے وقت احتیاط کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ćarʰćaniṅ</text></form>
</example>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.2.1 Land"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-04-04T02:08:56Z" dateModified="2025-12-31T15:46:49Z" id="charhkanesh_e9100f92-d7a4-40bd-8a41-3336024a35e8" guid="e9100f92-d7a4-40bd-8a41-3336024a35e8">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ćarʰkaneś</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
