</field>
<sense id="99576977-052d-47cb-86cc-e9a91a1a1a0f">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>contusion, a blunt force injury characterized by tissue damage without skin breakage, commonly occurring when the tissue is compressed or crushed by a solid external object.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>گبت مار، جلد کے نیچے زخم جو کچلن سے پید ا ہو۔   </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja aren ćarʰkaneś etam ba. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I have made contusion to my hand. I have bruised my hand. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-02-05T06:01:19Z" dateModified="2026-01-01T03:50:50Z" id="ćaspa2_f3d5af8a-6200-459c-a9e9-d3e743f75f37" guid="f3d5af8a-6200-459c-a9e9-d3e743f75f37">
