<entry dateCreated="2025-12-16T03:54:44Z" dateModified="2026-01-02T02:16:38Z" id="ćhaġor_fad1f933-7d5c-4632-a9b0-00c5e47da39f" guid="fad1f933-7d5c-4632-a9b0-00c5e47da39f">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ćhaġor</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>As a stand alone word, ćhaġor is now obsolete, replaced by ćhaġorum. However, the inflected form such is ćhaġorum (ćhaġor +um) and ćhaġorumi (ćhaġor +um +i) are widely used. </text></form>
</note>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Idioms"/>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>چھغوࣷر</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="eb1b6c43-6aec-4772-a71f-17028d6066e6">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>cold</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>سرد</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un paqo dećhaġor (de-ćhaġor). </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You make the food cool down. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-04-15T14:37:23Z" dateModified="2026-01-02T02:19:34Z" id="ćhaġorum_cd635c07-3cd9-4eca-aad8-a16bbc24c097" guid="cd635c07-3cd9-4eca-aad8-a16bbc24c097">
