<sense id="e5674fdf-c406-4d47-90da-0f40e224499f">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>40 days of extreme cold in the winter -- from December 21 to January 31. The period is known as nyu ćiláh. nyu ćiláh is followed by ećoġon ćiláh, a shorter period of 20 days.  </text></gloss>
