<form lang="bsk"><text>ʈʂɔr̥ʈʂor</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>څوࣷرْڅوࣷر</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="a3d3a29e-d0a7-45ef-9e5e-d5780e57a5fb">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>porous, with multiple holes</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>جھانجھر، سوراخوں سے بھرا</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>tariṅ ġallġo nidell c̣oʰrc̣or eti. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>After eating through it, the bug made the skin‑churn porous</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>girʰkise jaa pharʰce nidell c̣orʰc̣or etum bi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>By gnawing through it, the rat has rendered my cap porous. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
