<entry dateCreated="2020-04-14T15:56:33Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="dudi_d6d30a86-64dd-4f29-883b-692325eb0ff6" guid="d6d30a86-64dd-4f29-883b-692325eb0ff6">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>dudi</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="ḍóḍi_ffe136ff-03e4-4225-8ef8-c725e84a146f"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>dudi</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>دُدیࣷ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="5b161940-6de2-48fc-8f02-2f4cbef89df9">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>dudi is a talismanic writing on birch bark or paper, by a person regarded as a religious authority who may also have knowledge of spirits. Prayers or spells are inscribed on birch bark or paper and the paper is folded in a particular manner so as to make it a wick or incense. This wick is burned on one side and quickly fanned, leaving only the ember to release a smooth smoke. An ailing person then leans over the smoke for talismanic healing or spiritual cleansing. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>ایک طلسماتی نسخہ جس پر الہمامی عبارتیں لکھی جاتی ہیں اور پھر اُس کا لوبان بنا کر اُس کے دھویں کو شفا  کے طور پر استعمال کیا جاتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-03-02T05:12:35Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="dúgu_e4c412c8-4c8e-4fa9-b87b-1a8c07d08412" guid="e4c412c8-4c8e-4fa9-b87b-1a8c07d08412">
