<entry dateCreated="2020-04-12T04:58:54Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="ḍaṣṭáu_246a58c1-8f2b-48b4-a8bf-7e4ffc4edacf" guid="246a58c1-8f2b-48b4-a8bf-7e4ffc4edacf">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ḍaṣṭáu</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>ɖaʂʈʌu</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>ڈݜٹاۡ وࣷ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="0c938ca5-1579-405e-b6f5-d2397e175c66">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>It is a talismanic writing on a birch bark. Prayers or spells are inscribed on birch bark and the bark is immersed in water. When the writing mixes with the water, it is given to the ailing person to drink for talismanic or spiritual healing. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>طلسماتی نسخہ جو شتل کی چھال پر لکھا جاتا ہے اور پانی میں گول کر مریض کو پلایا جاتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-08-31T14:30:39Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="ḍaṣṭi_01138700-cf43-4ee2-82d4-6360ca608b37" guid="01138700-cf43-4ee2-82d4-6360ca608b37">
