</field>
<sense id="56ff2ddf-b038-4acf-b884-743de1b086bf">
<gloss lang="en"><text>Slaughtering an animal and preserving meat for long winter days in Gilgit-Baltistan is called ḍaṣti. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>نسالو</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
