<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>shapeless and bumpy, something with a lot of knobs, uneven</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>ادھر اُدھر اُبھری ہوئی شکل یا چیز</text></gloss>
</sense>
<sense id="52d8d710-886e-409a-8bfb-253cea3552df" order="1">
<gloss lang="en"><text>with positive and negative curvature. If something is not /ḍuqaḍaqa/ it is simply straight or plain or smooth. </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
