<entry dateCreated="2019-09-17T04:33:28Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="gacheli_dba01ed5-df6d-4dcd-8506-01a393232bdf" guid="dba01ed5-df6d-4dcd-8506-01a393232bdf">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>gacheli</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="yaṭiki _eb784e8c-78c2-4ca8-98be-20e3523d29b6"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>gatshɛli</text></form>
</field>
<trait name="Past Participle" value="P.PCTP: [-á,-í-ú,-én ]"/>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>گڎھیࣷلیٚ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="ba9fce38-f791-4d34-bbd1-02b4aa3c1fcc">
<grammatical-info value="Imperative">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Irrigate the crop (first time after plowing). This is what is called crown-root irrigation and ideally undertaken 20-25 days after casting seeds or when the crop crowns start to appear above ground.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کھیت کو سیراب کرو یا پانی دو۔ کاشت کے بعد پہلی دفعہ پانی دو</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-09-17T04:31:53Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="gachelićum_db49203c-d6b8-4d6d-bd01-d09afdf2994e" guid="db49203c-d6b8-4d6d-bd01-d09afdf2994e">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>gachelićum</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="bás chel_0a49d562-bb1b-4372-b85a-f3cd27038ebe"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>gatshɛlitʃum</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>گڎھیࣷلچُم</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="5ad8cc3b-b953-4745-bb59-64b081a405c3">
<grammatical-info value="Verb/Verbal Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Watering crops the first time ever (after plowing), crown-irrigation</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کاشت کے بعد پہلی دفعہ  فصل کو پانی دینا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>mall gacheli. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Water the crop field (for the first time)</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>jaa ac̣o mall gachelića nem bai. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>My brother has gone to do crown-irrigation. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2021-06-19T00:16:51Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="gachelukus_c8fccc4a-2ff9-48a4-8905-53e3585176f8" guid="c8fccc4a-2ff9-48a4-8905-53e3585176f8">
