<gloss lang="en"><text>defraying, paying back, returning back </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>چکانا یا ادا کرنا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>banke uṣ a<span lang="en">x</span>urum <span lang="en">x</span>aṣ gamića aiaamanam ba. </text></form>
