<sense id="da8cda3c-771d-4d03-91b7-2e40b4bc244f" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A situation in a bull fight where one animal overwhelms the other to recede.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>لڑائی میں زور لگا کر  پیچھے دھکیلنا یا پچھے ہٹنے پر مجبور کرنا۔</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>Se baardum hare matúm har girgira waśiy</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>The red bull put the black bull in a receding position.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>"Ṣoṅgir, ṣongir lloq bape hár ṣoṅgir Mulʰtane khar ṣongir, oy lloġar, ṣonġir" Dr. Faiz Aman</text></form>
</example>
</sense>
