<entry dateCreated="2024-04-25T13:24:02Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="-ġares_4a33ac5c-d63d-437a-bf41-f28f3d1cc8cd" guid="4a33ac5c-d63d-437a-bf41-f28f3d1cc8cd">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ġares</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="duġares_0eb4ada1-71ea-4986-91d6-759a9ce2575a"/>
<trait name="do-not-publish-in" value="Idioms"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>-ɣarɛs</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>غریࣷس</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Possessed">
<form lang="bsk"><text>ġares</text></form>
</field>
<trait name="Possessors" value="DePrifix -e,o"/>
<sense id="1c86efd2-bde5-4032-aae7-63ced6d6a150">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>always prefixed with /d/ and with pronominal infixes, it gives a sense of inquiry or questioning۔</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>اس کے ساتھ "د"  سابقہ لگتا ہے اور پھیر ضمیری اِن فکس کے ساتھ استفسار کے لیے استعمال ہوتا ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un ja acum duġares</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You ask (it) from me. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un ne deġares</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You ask him. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un nee cum duġares.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You ask (it) from him. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>we sese uyek, guya tati cum duġares. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Ask the name of those people from your father. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un we ses dóġares, we boóta gute doro eten. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You ask those people, why did they do this work. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja mo gus domóġaresá. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I asked that woman. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja mo gús mo muyek duġaresá. </text></form>
