</field>
<sense id="e4c4e70d-fcc8-482a-8d35-c14c73485a6a">
<gloss lang="en"><text>an ancient post-harvest tradition observed by boys. They visit houses in the neighborhood, typically they go on the roof-tops, perform a peculiar chanting through the sám, until they are offered a treat or gift.  The tradition seem more like a Trick-a-treating that is observed in North America.</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
