<trait name="Review 1" value="202503051"/>
<sense id="df9fb994-5815-4862-bc47-b0b6781bf9cb">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A narrow space at the lower end of a traditional Burusho house, this area is slightly sunken compared to the rest of the living space and is separated by húndares. Visitors entering the house pass through this space. Guests exchange greetings with the host family and remove their shoes here.</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
