<entry dateCreated="2021-02-20T21:58:11Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="huyesiṅa oćum_d95f5cf3-c9c8-4d05-b5c0-f00578b8f696" guid="d95f5cf3-c9c8-4d05-b5c0-f00578b8f696">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>huyesiṅa oćum</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="phrase"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="heṭa doćum_e9879f41-08fa-4029-95e8-e9f967699260"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>huyɛsiŋa otʃum</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>ہُییࣷسِ ئنٚگا اوࣷچُم</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="2e0297da-bb45-451a-a77f-0ed7fccb532c">
<gloss lang="en"><text>Pastoral ism, goats and sheep are taken up to higher pastures during the day while Bovines stay around the houses. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بھیڑ بکریوں کو دن کو پہاڑوں پر چرانے کے لیے لے جایا جاتا ہے جس کوhuyésinǧa ochum کہتے ہیں۔  </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
