<sense id="a21b0ea7-f15a-446e-804c-3cf02dd803ac" order="0">
<gloss lang="en"><text>with (possession), -full; having or possessing (something), bearing</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>مند( جیسے دولت مند) والا(جیسے طاقت والا)</text></gloss>
<example>
