<sense id="dc9a1a5c-e845-47bc-979c-39b958d97728">
<gloss lang="en"><text>suffix appended to a verb in order to give a sense of permission, approval or recommendation. Only used for 3rd  Person Singular. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>لاحقہ جو فعل کے ساتھ لگتا ہے  اور  واحد غائیب کے لیے تائید  یا حکم  کا عنصر دیتا ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>Ja giraaśa awulam, ne giraatiṣ. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I would not abe able to dance, he should dance. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne hir hurutiṣ</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>(1) The man should sit.  (2) Let the man be seated.  </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
