<form lang="bsk"><text>-iu</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>اِؤ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="bbfc45b7-3490-452b-82f0-ee923397fde2">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
<trait name="type" value="inflAffix"/>
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>For certain nouns of the X-class, typically ending in -en, the plural is formed by dropping -en and adding -iu.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>لاحقہ جو بعض الفاظ کو جمع بناتا ہے، جیسے کھن سے کِھؤ</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>c̣hen, c̣hiu</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>sparrow, sparrows</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>phen, phiu</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>fly, flies</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>khen, khiu</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>flea, fleas</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
