<form lang="bsk"><text>ʒaːɫ ɛt</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="78d7e7d7-c5d5-43b4-921b-854b14dd71cf" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Imperative">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>pass through water, rinse it.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>خالی پانی میں تھوڑا سا  کنگال لو۔</text></gloss>
</sense>
<sense id="6a8b0c88-4bc5-4f0c-ac75-57e26b917e0d" order="1">
<grammatical-info value="Imperative">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>water the crop fields or plants in a way that the process is quick but the water is just enough.  </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>جلدی جلدی  کسی کھیت یا  پودوں کو سیراب کرو۔</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja maliṅ jaall eta. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I irrigated the cropland lightly. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
