</field>
<sense id="8c6689fc-0c17-446f-9156-947164361dfa">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>This ritual food is tied to the tradition of grain storage in a communal pit. After years of preservation, when the grain is finally retrieved for consumption, a small portion is set aside and mixed with other foods. An elder, regarded as a symbol of wisdom and respect, is the first to partake, inaugurating the harvest's consumption with a ceremonial act۔</text></gloss>
<example>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
