<entry dateCreated="2020-05-18T05:45:50Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="mamukiṣ_5cda65ae-7172-4b5a-a48a-22da633cd203" guid="5cda65ae-7172-4b5a-a48a-22da633cd203">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>mamukiṣ</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="mućhanjáll_57e91ac6-d26f-42cf-b6e6-a7001ff4cd0c"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>mamukiʂ</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>ممکِݜ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="d8e6c5b2-2b2f-4f40-8932-67ee4daee481">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Mamukiṣ serves as a cold storage space for dairy products. Traditionally, it is a simple, well-ventilated room strategically located near trees and water sources. The combination of fresh air, cool water, and the shade provided by the trees helps maintain the freshness of dairy products, ensuring their quality over time.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>سرد خانہ جس میں دودھ سے بنی اشیا رکھی جاتی ہیں۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
