<sense id="074f83ef-237e-40f7-a9ef-e98d6963cf02">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>(of culinary) paste or dough of fruit kernel. It is particularly the paste that remains after extracting oil from the kernel. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>پھلوں کے گیری سے بنایا گیا گودا</text></gloss>
<example>
