<entry dateCreated="2019-04-17T05:25:44Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="menadari ġa cherem_cff37f40-c1b3-4528-b3f4-bc948e087055" guid="cff37f40-c1b3-4528-b3f4-bc948e087055">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>menadari ġa cherem</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="phrase"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>mɛnadari ɣa tshɛrɛm</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>میناداری غاࣷ ڎھیریم</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="264efdca-8786-4b56-9fdc-64a028a6538d">
<grammatical-info value="Verb/Verbal Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A custom in Yasin where family of bride will go to the family of the bridal to formally pay gratitude for giving their daughter's hand. It is normally right after an engagement is confirmed.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>منگنی کے  بعد لڑکی کے گھروالوں  اور قریبی رشتہ داروں  کے گھر جاکر شکر گزاری بجا لانا۔</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
