</field>
<sense id="b4ab9b2f-f70d-4c37-a955-6a5e0e378e4f">
<grammatical-info value="Adverb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Milking an animal immediately after it was already milked is called parʰki. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>دودھ دھونے کے بعد پھر سے دوھ لینا۔</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2024-07-16T17:00:43Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="parʰki2_b4de445c-92dd-4c71-af68-31350c8f54fb" guid="b4de445c-92dd-4c71-af68-31350c8f54fb">
