<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>milking an animal such as goat second time around to ensure no more milk is left</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>دوسری دفعہ جانور کو دوھ لینا</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
