<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text> A traditional game of skill and speed, where players toss a round stone into the air and swiftly attempt to pick up two or more stones from the ground before catching the airborne one. The game follows a structured set of rules and progresses through increasingly challenging stages, testing coordination, timing, and dexterity.</text></gloss>
