<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A place in Darkot, Yasin, where English explorer George Jonas Whitaker Hayward was murdered by the agents of the Mehraja of Kashmir. The literal meaning of the the name is the ravine of the westerner. </text></gloss>
