<sense id="58582eef-a6b7-41ef-b623-4e11fd28c8b9">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>An expression used for extreme burn, itch or cold. In all the three situations, it is common that people seek comfort by blowing the affected area. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>سخت سردی ، جلن یا خارش کو بیان کرنے کے لیے استعمال ہوتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
