</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>It is mostly used to store drop-spindle and wool. Ancient Burusho phurukús was probably made of reed which in Buruśaaski is called /phurú/</text></form>
</note>
