<entry dateCreated="2019-12-31T01:16:46Z" dateModified="2025-08-22T16:17:46Z" id="phuṣṭik_a965a54d-2be1-4fe7-8e5a-f503c8bacaea" guid="a965a54d-2be1-4fe7-8e5a-f503c8bacaea">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>phuṣṭik</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="mán chel_27e098d9-8366-49a4-9b51-88a607e4793e"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>pʰuʂʈik</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Plural Suffix">
<form lang="bsk"><text>iśu</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="4b08c635-0ce8-4a08-baaa-c78c29bd3b73">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Whey bars are made by cooking whey over fire until it thickens into a paste. This paste is then dried in the sun, forming phuṣṭik. The bars are used as ingredients in tuśmáć, a soupy dish. phuṣṭik is rich in protein and can also be used as an additive in various other foods.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>دودھ کو پکا کر  پنیر بنایا جاتا ہے، پھر پنیر کو الگ کرکے اُس پانی کو  پکا کر پروٹین کی ٹیکیاں بنائی  جاتی ہیں جن کو کو پُھݜٹک  کہا جاتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
</example>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.2 Food"/>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-09-29T18:54:59Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="phut_a786f218-c5a6-4ea7-a79d-796dcb473441" guid="a786f218-c5a6-4ea7-a79d-796dcb473441">
