</field>
<sense id="48fb0e08-a278-451d-8794-9fcacec3293e">
<grammatical-info value="Verb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>(of group) reactively moving off quickly to different directions. disperse or scatter reactively. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>منتشر ہونا خاص کر  رد عمل کے طور پر </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>bape hek dooll c̣iġ eća, <span lang="en">x</span>akindaru phuẓaa manen.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>When the aged man screamed loudly, the daughter-in-laws moved off quickly in different directions (out of fear).</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
