</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>safflower, used as an alternate of saffron in cooking.  This herb is grown in gardens and the flowers are dried and used as herbal tea. There are other culinary usage of  the /póṅ/</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>یہ ذرد رنگ کا پھول زعفران کے متبادل استعمال ہوتا ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.5 Plant"/>
</sense>
</entry>
