<sense id="38ec2285-6be3-4282-be63-7cb62c3b7971">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Describes something that has been thoroughly explored, investigated, or examined with depth and detail. Often used to characterize subjects, topics, places or materials that have undergone extensive observation, scrutiny or thoughtful analysis.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>چھان، چھان بین، جگہ نہ چھوڑنا</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja akhii dalla kye sahv jaġáiṅ puc̣úti etám ba. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Up around here, I have sifted through all places. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
