<sense id="6e70d043-d6cd-4722-8f20-4b13cc439596">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>An aromatic herb used for culinary or medicinal purpose. Burned substance of /qaqaśu/ is used to fight pinworm infection in children. </text></gloss>
