<sense id="a1899bfd-4e1f-4715-b6f4-1cc58e1335bf" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>spirit, soul, the epitome of one's emotions and character. Rãc̣i lives within a body and some times travels outside of body. In some cases, as told in legends, a person meets his/her own rāc̣i. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>آتما، روح</text></gloss>
</sense>
<sense id="85f6353f-423e-4de0-8223-34bfbb7646eb" order="1">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>spirit, essence </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>جان، روح</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>go guyek aidesam, ja bariṅe daa bo rac̣i. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>What then (would be the) spirit of my prose, without mentioning your name. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
