<sense id="79890296-075e-4ddc-b1dd-771258f30ee5">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>ready or pretend to be ready only to back off at the very last moment.  Ready with hesitation, reluctantly ready</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>تیار ہونا یا تیار دیکھائی دینا (مگر اکثر آخری وقت پرپیچھے ہٹنا)</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne rikrik nima ćirʰkani beé</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>He did not jump, (despite) after being ready</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
