<sense id="10021646-d2ac-4b44-9edc-aa604649392a">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A silver or white ornament that woman used to wear. Historically it is said to be made of a special fish bone. In later ages it transitioned into silver and eventually went out of fashion, and became rare. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>سفید  گول چاندی یا ہڈی سے بنا  زیور</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-10-26T14:06:11Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="sadahvi_91738f93-6301-4308-a8dd-fffecf9e56bd" guid="91738f93-6301-4308-a8dd-fffecf9e56bd">
