<sense id="24a8a1e4-9cdf-42ec-896c-46f023fc1888">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>(of female goats) having round patches of white color on their body -- patches resembling the sadahv</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>جانور خاص کر جس کا جسم  یہاں وہاں صدف کی طرح سفید رنگ کا ہو۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>jaa se sadahvi cigir waallum bi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>My goat, which has white round patches on its body, is missing</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-01-28T22:54:51Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="sáġaśum_ec1fc232-c2bd-4e0d-9de5-cd6e00c35093" guid="ec1fc232-c2bd-4e0d-9de5-cd6e00c35093">
