<gloss lang="en"><text>tenacious, a person who would not desist or refrain, no matter who says what, defiant, unyielding</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>وہ جو باز نہ مانے۔</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>thá goġa sena, putunaṅ ce aidohon noxa, ajo serex baastuma daa. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I told you hundred times not to mess with the burning wood. you happens to be such an unyielding person. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2021-03-18T23:32:00Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="ses1_87d219b4-b70b-4f40-a450-b5abc4830454" guid="87d219b4-b70b-4f40-a450-b5abc4830454">
