<form lang="ur-PK"><text>شریࣷش</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="061ec213-8a03-43f3-9033-8ad74fb6c73c">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>in a state of dazzling,  state of being dazzled by bright light.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>چکا چوندی، (تیز روشنی کی وجہ سے) انکھوں کا چوندھیا جانا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>sa yakalla ġana ka, gulʰćimo śareś gooćemen.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Your eyes will be  dazzled if you look towards the sun. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2020-09-19T17:39:34Z" dateModified="2025-10-08T01:12:46Z" id="śargaśta_dc78e60f-7ddc-4c39-8421-f0c7ac142f83" guid="dc78e60f-7ddc-4c39-8421-f0c7ac142f83">
