<gloss lang="en"><text>Indoor children's game where participants compete for remaining silent for the longest time. The first person uttering something will loose. Quite game.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بچوں کا کھیل جس میں خاموش رہنے کا مقابلہ ہوتا ہے۔</text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.2.6.1 Game"/>
</sense>
</entry>
