</field>
<sense id="455be317-d4b9-4810-b373-5ccd8ab503fe">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A long sleeved robe or cloak made of wool. It resembles more like the Central Asian chugha, popular in Kazakhstan, Tajikistan etc. It is mostly used by men in winter. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>گلگتی چوغہ جو اُون سے بنا ہوتا ہے </text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.3 Clothing"/>
</sense>
</entry>
