<grammatical-info value="Noun">
<trait name="type" value="inflAffix"/>
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Plural suffix used with some maternal and paternal relationship roles. The following relationship roles will take -śtaru to make them plural. </text></gloss>
