<grammatical-info value="Adverb">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A onomatopoeic word for smooth and quickness, probably from śar śar which is associated with the sound of rain. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>جلدی جلدی، فر فر</text></gloss>
<example>
