<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A fried dough food similar to Mongolian cookies (Boortsog). It can be made in different shapes, mostly triangular. Traditionally it used to be saltish but sugar is also used as an alternate to the salt.</text></gloss>
