</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>The word will take pronominal prefixes when used for human being. The word is pronounced with the starting consonant as /t/, however as possessed word the -lʰtaali- such as alʰtali or mulʰtali. </text></form>
</note>
