<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>a feast to celebrate the preparation of crop. In the upper regions of Yásin, when the crop of barley is matured, a sample of barley spikes are brought home. Some rituals are performed and a special agro-cultural food is served. This festival or ritual is called /tarʰqeṣ/</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
