<form lang="ur-PK"><text>تَوُن</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="8b4eabef-9f73-478e-be94-050375c0c668">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>upstanding fixed storage box for flour or grains. It is a fixed structure behind the upper-end pillars, within the traditional Burusho house</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>آٹا یا آناج   رکھنے کے لیے بنائی گئی الماری نما جگہ</text></gloss>
<trait name ="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.1 Household equipment"/>
</sense>
</entry>
