</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>تھسِنٚا ایࣷچم</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="33a27b5a-50a8-4714-b8a8-67b6a7795359">
<gloss lang="en"><text>making a smoke out of someone, knocking someone out</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>کسی کو دھوا بنانا، مار کر بے ہوش کردینا۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>nukudell ja un thasiṅa goćam</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>I will knock you out by hitting you.</text></form>
