<entry dateCreated="2021-05-29T22:32:48Z" dateModified="2025-11-09T15:09:27Z" id="thó_1df80f86-590e-4e98-abff-14635bd22d4b" guid="1df80f86-590e-4e98-abff-14635bd22d4b">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>thó</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="Thoo Das_b73c1604-0855-476e-b710-65fea97c7e48"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="thó dećum_ae120f72-b3dc-432a-bf61-12bb66c50575"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>thɔ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="53683153-3eab-4cb5-885f-036391bee1ec">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>grade-able rugged land that has potential to be transformed into an arable land. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بنجر زمین جسے زرعی مقصد کے لیا تیار کیا جاسکتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2019-09-15T14:04:00Z" dateModified="2025-11-09T15:04:09Z" id="thó dećum_ae120f72-b3dc-432a-bf61-12bb66c50575" guid="ae120f72-b3dc-432a-bf61-12bb66c50575">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>thó dećum</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="thó_1df80f86-590e-4e98-abff-14635bd22d4b"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>thɔ dɛtʃum</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="c5106128-168f-4483-ba8a-80b2eca5adda">
<grammatical-info value="Verb/Verbal Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>In Burushaski, thó dećum refers to the process of transforming a rugged, uncultivated terrain into arable land through digging, leveling, and clearing.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>بنجر زمین کو کھود کر، ہموار بنا کر اور صاف کرکے کاشت کے قابل بنا نا۔</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ja bape gute draan thó nidell máll dewusi.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>My grandfather transformed this rugged slope into an arable field. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2025-11-09T15:09:27Z" dateModified="2025-11-09T15:10:40Z" id="Thoo Das_b73c1604-0855-476e-b710-65fea97c7e48" guid="b73c1604-0855-476e-b710-65fea97c7e48">
