<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>tʊs aidusi</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>تُس ائدُوسی</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="308b9ec4-6356-45fa-b769-b73d350b0fff">
<grammatical-info value="Idiom">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>The grave did not easily open for getting buried (of the shame or embarrassment that was felt), being extremely ashamed. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>انتہايی شرمندہ، اتنا شرمندہ کی منہ چھپانے کی جگہ نہ ہو۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2025-10-20T13:41:05Z" dateModified="2025-10-20T13:43:15Z" id="tús aiduusiṣ_edf27a98-1929-4dcc-9742-f3bb163cc943" guid="edf27a98-1929-4dcc-9742-f3bb163cc943">
