</field>
<sense id="17374cb9-d3b3-4b15-807f-039b2376aea2">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>aposthic , born circumcised. According to some Islamic and Jewish sources, certain prophets were born aposthic, and if a baby is born without foreskin, circumcision is not required.  </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>ختنہ جو قدرتی طور پر ہو چکا ہو۔ ابراہمی مذاہب میں اس صورت میں مزید ختنے کی ضرورت نہیں پڑتی۔ </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>khene halles ehuruṭum ban be. Khene ućuṣ bai. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>This boy is not circumcised. He is with aposthia.  (born circumcised)</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
