<entry dateCreated="2020-01-31T15:46:17Z" dateModified="2025-10-22T00:21:47Z" id="uṅgáló_185a1abf-5529-4d37-abef-dcca2114f3ad" guid="185a1abf-5529-4d37-abef-dcca2114f3ad">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>uṅgáló</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>uŋgʌlɔ</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>اُنگَلو</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="5ca8ac41-cb3d-41b4-8d1b-0aac1c984c72">
<grammatical-info value="Adjective">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>Sensitivity of bones or joints to barometric pressure. Previously fractured bones or joints become sensitivity to weather changes. Most people experience flared-up pain and predict weather changes such as rain. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>ہڈیوں اور جوڑوں کا پورانا  درد جو ہو ا اور موسم کی تبدیلی کی وجہ سے پید ا ہوتا ہے۔ </text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2021-06-26T16:45:04Z" dateModified="2025-10-22T00:19:05Z" id="uráġ_2fd45880-0f18-4065-9239-f47e0e3deff0" guid="2fd45880-0f18-4065-9239-f47e0e3deff0">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>uráġ</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="yaraġ_1166812e-db21-4fb8-956a-78ea70aec4a4"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>urʌɣ</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>اُرَغ</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="70489e17-8e52-43cf-8c50-6dc1a0e8e40b" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>The part of the horse's body where a rider gives a spurring pat, in order to urge or control the horse.  The spurring pat can either be with one's calf or heel. </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>گھوڑے کے جسم کا وہ حصہ جہاں ایڑ لگا کر گھوڑے کو اُ کسایا جاتا ہے۔  </text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>haġor uráġ dell</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Give the horse a spurring pat. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
<sense id="8b22ac90-41f7-4518-8d15-1b4ed3457740" order="1">
<gloss lang="en"><text>The practice of spurring a horse with one's heel or calf</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>گھوڑے کو ایڑ لگا کر اُکسانے یا کنٹرول کرنے کا عمل</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>haġór uráġa waśi.</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Put the horse into a spurring mode.</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
