</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>pinch (unit of measurement), smallest unit of measurement for powdery substance such as snuff, sugar, flour, salt etc.  </text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>پُھنکی</text></gloss>
</sense>
</entry>
