<sense id="e0d7121f-c271-4794-a81a-9f0dde08d37a" order="1">
<gloss lang="en"><text>to satisfy one's desire to the fullest, thoroughly enjoying</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>، خو ب لطف  اندوز ہ ہونا۔  خواہش کی  تسکین کرنا</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>ne echoġon giraśa phat et, <span lang="en">x</span>omar gali ka, ilja ćhuurimi. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>Let the kid play (outside), when he breaks his desire (enjoys to the full), he will return back (home)</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
