<entry dateCreated="2019-09-27T16:19:34Z" dateModified="2025-11-12T14:46:15Z" id="-yam_076a7e86-d4c7-4b20-8202-3fbf59bc94cd" guid="076a7e86-d4c7-4b20-8202-3fbf59bc94cd" order="1">
<lexical-unit>
<form lang="bsk"><text>-yam</text></form>
</lexical-unit>
<trait  name="morph-type" value="suffix"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="beheyam_a5ce1108-ec1d-4e96-be31-e6c8ce071514"/>
<relation type="Compare" ref="-yán_e09059ff-f09c-40d7-9e2c-b5d29cf7d742"/>
<field type="IPA Burushaski">
<form lang="bsk"><text>-yam</text></form>
</field>
<field type="Perso Arabic Burushaski">
<form lang="ur-PK"><text>یَم</text></form>
</field>
<sense id="60797d6c-53a7-4c32-a02b-528716e255c3">
<gloss lang="en"><text>1SG future suffix, replaces final nasal consonants, mostly 'n', in Burushahski imperative verbs to form 1st person future (e.g., dichan → dichayam). Exception: if the nasal consonants is preceded by a diphthong or long vowel 'i', use –ćam instead (e.g., c̣hoin → c̣hoinćam, girmiin → girmiinćam ).

</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text> واحد متکلم (1SG) کے لیے مستقبل کا لاحقہ –yam، امر (imperative) افعال کے آخر میں آنے والے حرف –n کی جگہ لیتا ہے تاکہ واحد متکلم مستقبل بنایا جا سکے (مثلاً: dichan→ dichayam)۔استثنا: اگر –n سے پہلے دو حرفی صوت (diphthong) یا طویل حرفِ علت 'i' ہو، تو –ćam استعمال ہوتا ہے (مثلاً: c̣hoin → c̣hoinćam، girmiin → girmiinćam)۔</text></gloss>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un hen, ja heyam</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>you known, I will know</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un ses guman, ja ses amayam. </text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You be a human being, I will be a human being</text></form>
</translation>
</example>
<example>
<form lang="bsk"><text>un axaten, ja axateyam</text></form>
<translation type="Free translation">
<form lang="en"><text>You do not say it, I will not say it. </text></form>
</translation>
</example>
</sense>
</entry>
<entry dateCreated="2025-11-10T04:25:54Z" dateModified="2025-11-12T14:46:15Z" id="-yam2_e593db60-6272-4303-b5cc-629ed5400015" guid="e593db60-6272-4303-b5cc-629ed5400015" order="2">
