<trait  name="morph-type" value="stem"/>
<note>
<form lang="en"><text>This word is found in both Shina and Khowar. Only in Burushaski it requires pronominal prefixes. Loan words in Burushaski do not require Possessors.  The word has been compared with Sunskrit's yogya by Hermann Berger. </text></form>
</note>
