<sense id="533c6877-f212-40fd-94f0-5344a1b4b28b" order="0">
<grammatical-info value="Noun">
</grammatical-info>
<gloss lang="en"><text>A traditional method of capturing falcons using a man-made enclosure. A person sits concealed inside the structure, while a live chicken is placed outside as bait. When a falcon descends to seize the chicken, the trapper reaches out and captures the bird.</text></gloss>
<gloss lang="ur-PK"><text>باز پکڑنے کا ایک طریقہ</text></gloss>
</sense>
<sense id="8cbcadcc-9ce9-43d0-95e7-0249682f611d" order="1">
</sense>
</entry>
